   "id": 645915,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"7\">\n  <li>Choose an equation that makes it easier to find the amount of gas left in the tank, <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>, if we know the car has traveled <span data-math=\"d\">d</span> miles.</li>\n</ol>",
